Significance: patch
Type: changed

The confirmation email for an RSVP without an account now goes out from cron through the shared Mailer, so submitting the RSVP no longer waits on the mail server. Its link works for 24 hours from when the email is sent, rather than from when the RSVP was made, and an unconfirmed RSVP is removed 24 hours after its email went out.
